
"smart_sources:30-Resouces/01-Software/01.OS/(7条消息)xManger6中单击键盘出现两个字符的问题解决 - shangxiaqiusuo1的博.md": {"path":"30-Resouces/01-Software/01.OS/(7条消息)xManger6中单击键盘出现两个字符的问题解决 - shangxiaqiusuo1的博.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"15v7doj","at":1781360118495},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1780711534474,"size":921,"at":1781360118530,"hash":"15v7doj"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,5],"#":[7,7],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>解决办法，很刚很猛烈。</span>":[8,8],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>1、打开Xbrowser.exe之后，点击最上面的工具。</span>":[9,9],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>2、点击Xconfig 开始。打开如下界面：</span>":[10,11],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>2、点击Xconfig 开始。打开如下界面：</span>#{1}":[11,11],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>3、右键点击Default Profile ，选择属性。</span>":[12,12],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>4、在打开的界面里面选择高级。在如下界面中可以看到红圈里的XKEYBOARD，本来是打上对勾的，点一下对勾，取消选择这个选项。然后问题解决。</span>":[13,16],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>4、在打开的界面里面选择高级。在如下界面中可以看到红圈里的XKEYBOARD，本来是打上对勾的，点一下对勾，取消选择这个选项。然后问题解决。</span>#{1}":[14,16]},"outlinks":[{"title":"image1","target":"db4ea4c94ebe4b6faf1675f677d5f727.png","line":11,"embedded":true},{"title":"image2","target":"be15871cb00542929e400960ca9ec1e3.png","line":14,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"(7条消息)xManger6中单击键盘出现两个字符的问题解决 - shangxiaqiusuo1的博...","updated":"2026-06-06T10:05","created":"2019-09-27T23:29:48"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:30-Resouces/01-Software/01.OS/(7条消息)xManger6中单击键盘出现两个字符的问题解决 - shangxiaqiusuo1的博.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"42if4n","at":1781360118495},"key":"30-Resouces/01-Software/01.OS/(7条消息)xManger6中单击键盘出现两个字符的问题解决 - shangxiaqiusuo1的博.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,5],"size":123,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
